# Turn order, reversal, Edge, VP and replacing a player.
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
seat D dave
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
crypt C "Tomas Grey" *12
crypt D "Tomas Grey" *12
start

A> next
A> next
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A discard
A> next
expect turn 2 B unlock
log public Turn 2: B's unlock phase
reject:forbidden A> next

# Reversing play order only changes who takes the next turn (GAME-20).
B> direction predator
expect direction predator
B> next
B> next
B> next
B> next
B> next
expect turn 3 A unlock
A> direction prey
A> next
A> next
A> next
A> next
A> next
expect turn 4 B unlock

A> edge me
expect edge A
C> vp +1 C
C> vp +0.5 C
expect vp C 1.5
reject C> vp +0.25 C

# An admin can hand a stalled seat to a willing player (GAME-19).
admin> replace B erin
expect occupant B erin
B> draw crypt 1
expect count B:uncontrolled 1
reject:forbidden admin> pool +1 A
reject:invalid admin> replace C erin
